name: ['Call of the Conclave', 'Dimir Charm', 'Experiment One', 'Farseek', 'Ghor-Clan Rampager', 'Grisly Salvage', 'Izzet Charm', "Judge's Familiar", 'Rakdos Cackler', 'Reliquary Tower', 'Searing Spear', 'Sin Collector']
